sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin
    participant UI as "Interface: UI"
    participant API as "mainController: Controller"
    participant Config as "configurationService: Service"
    participant Map as "googleMapsProvider: External System"
    participant DB as "PostgreSQL: Database"
    Admin->>UI: Edit warehouse address, service radius or ETA settings
    UI->>+API: PUT /api/v1/warehouses/{id} and /configurations/{key}
    API->>+Config: validateAndSaveConfiguration(request)
    Config->>+Map: Geocode address or refresh distance data
    Map-->>-Config: Coordinates/distance or controlled provider error
    Config->>+DB: Save versioned location, transit and schedule settings
    DB-->>-Config: Configuration version
    Config-->>-API: Updated configuration
    API-->>-UI: Display saved settings
    Note over Config,DB: API keys stay server-side; allocation snapshots the versions used for ETA and distance.

